  "notes": "Message metadata and activity feedback: every message now shows a local-time timestamp. User metadata is right-aligned as Sent · time · name, while assistant metadata remains left-aligned as XemAi · time. The working indicator now has animated dots and progresses through thinking/still thinking/still working states. Active reply state is shared per chat so another open device viewing the same conversation can also see that XemAi is working. Typing is not claimed until true token streaming exists.",
